<h2>Future of Robotics and Data Science</h2>
<p>Robotics has come a long way since their humble beginnings as simple, pre-programmed machines that performed monotonous tasks like welding, painting, and screwing.</p>
<p>The inclusion of data science into the mix has allowed robots to evolve into autonomous, intelligent machines that can learn, adapt, and problem-solve in the face of changing environments.</p>
<p>But this progress brings new ethical considerations to the table. To ensure a prosperous future for robotics, we must be vigilant about data science and robotics ethics and strive towards a smarter, more responsible use of this powerful technology.</p>
<p>Only then can we ensure that these technologies are used to create a better world, not a more dangerous one.</p>
