<ul>
<li>
<h3><strong>Free Resources: YouTube Channels and Self-Study</strong></h3>
</li>
</ul>
<p>If you are exploring data science before committing to a full program, these YouTube channels offer high-quality, free learning. None of these are training institutes. They are individual creators focused on education.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/joshstarmer">StatQuest with Josh Starmer</a>:</strong> Best for statistics and ML fundamentals. Breaks down complex concepts with clear visuals. Over 1 million subscribers.</li>
