<th><strong>Average Salary</strong></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>Bengaluru</strong></td>
<td>The biggest tech cluster, ample job opportunities, and high competition for talent, attracting premium pay</td>
<td>₹16.5 LPA</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Gurgaon</strong></td>
<td>Large MNC &#x26; fintech presence ensures strong demand and competitive pay</td>
<td>₹17.2 LPA</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Mumbai</strong></td>
<td>The financial capital of India ensures a higher premium, especially in the BFSI sector</td>
<td>₹15.2 LPA</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Hyderabad</strong></td>
<td>Growing tech hub and is competitive but slightly below Bangalore in a few roles</td>
<td>₹15.8 LPA</td>
</tr>
