<td><strong>Pune / Chennai</strong></td>
<td>Strong IT presence, but has a moderate cost of living, leading to modest pay</td>
<td>₹15.2 LPA</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Tier-2 Cities (e.g., Jaipur, Kochi, Indore)</strong></td>
<td>Lower demand concentration leading to lower base pay, but this can be offset by significantly lower cost of living</td>
