<p>The three ways to protect an Excel workbook are:</p>
<ol>
<li>Password protection for opening a workbook</li>
<li>Protection against manipulating sheets such as adding, deleting, hiding, and unhiding sheets</li>
<li>Protection against changing window size or position</li>
</ol>
