<h3><strong>Communication and Data Storytelling</strong></h3>
<p><img src="https://tumfgdyurswklrzsnevv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/uploads/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/cover-image-768x513-5.png" alt="storytelling skills"></p>
<ul>
<li>
<h3><strong>Presenting Data Insights Effectively</strong></h3>
</li>
