<td>Pytorch is comparatively new and less widely used than other machine learning frameworks.It has a much smaller developer community, and fewer people know extensively about using and troubleshooting PyTorch.Debugging can also be challenging when dealing with complex models due to its lack of support for imperative programming.It does not have expanded tools such as monitoring and visualization.</td>
